{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10641040","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10641040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1064104001:0":{"text":"あぁああぁぁっ！！","source_cn":"啊——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE70D9BD70A081E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064104002:0":{"text":"だ、誰……？お母さんに何をする気だ！？","source_cn":"你、你是谁？！你要对我妈妈做什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA5C4296CB33E91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064104003:0":{"text":"黒魔術を操る悪人には、裁きが必要だ。","source_cn":"操纵黑魔法的恶徒，必须受到裁决。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC057481853D1D4FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064104004:1":{"text":"どけ。","source_cn":"让开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A33796FF67FE3A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064104005:1":{"text":"黒魔術？何だよ、それ！？お母さんが悪人なはずないだろ！","source_cn":"不可能！我妈妈才不是坏人！一定是你搞错了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD293BEE425ABD575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064104006:0":{"text":"それに……エンサ村の人でもないじゃないか！お前にいったい何が分かる！？","source_cn":"而且……而且你不是恩莎村的人！一定是你在撒谎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADA4A86CF3874E30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064104007:1":{"text":"あ、アタリア様……やっと追いついた……","source_cn":"艾、艾雅在上……阿塔利娅大人，总算跟上您了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF0FAA838CD568FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064104008:1":{"text":"……ど、どうしてエミーニさんに武器を向けておられるのですか？彼女はリロさんの妻で、被害者なんですよ！","source_cn":"……您、您为什么要拿武器对准埃米妮？她是列罗的妻子，是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE03A8C57CBE0BDAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064104009:1":{"text":"遺体に黒魔術を施したのはこいつだ。","source_cn":"尸体上的黑魔法，是她施加的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x807063A5F9FB93C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064104010:1":{"text":"すでに邪悪に堕ちており、裁きが必要だ。","source_cn":"她已堕入邪恶，必须清除。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F004AF59BC8D98B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064104011:1":{"text":"黒魔術？あ、アタリア様……エミーニさんは無実です。ただの一般人で、何かの間違いでは……","source_cn":"黑魔法？不，阿塔利娅大人，埃米妮只是一个无辜的普通人，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AE0DC85C153A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064104012:1":{"text":"女神を冒涜するブラックゴールドのメンバーが、無実などありえない！","source_cn":"黑金成员全都是亵渎女神的邪恶之徒！何来无辜？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x205A6648E7E17292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064104013:1":{"text":"奴らの罪は許されるものではなく、正義を保つには裁きあるのみだ！","source_cn":"他们犯下的罪行不可饶恕！唯有裁决才可维持正义！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A2CA36D847BC676","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064104014:1":{"text":"ブラックゴールド……？彼女がそんな連中の一員なはずがありません！戦争が終わってから、彼女はエンサ村を出ていないんですよ！","source_cn":"黑金商会？可是……可是埃米妮不可能是他们的成员啊！战争...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7799B222AACFFB43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064104015:0":{"text":"エミーニさんも……早くアタリア様に説明してください！","source_cn":"埃米妮，你快向阿塔利娅大人解释一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2EBB41120375151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064104016:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064104017:0":{"text":"いいえ、彼女は正しい……言いましたよね、すべて私のせいだって……","source_cn":"不，她说的没错……所有一切，都是因为我的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x554F5830C08D106A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064104018:0":{"text":"若い頃にあれほどの罪を犯していなければ、家族がこのような報いを受けずに済んだのに……","source_cn":"如果不是我年轻时犯下了那么多罪，我的家人也不会遭到如今...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E04D83B915116F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064104019:0":{"text":"すでに過ちを認めたのなら、裁きを受け、その罪を償え。","source_cn":"你既已认罪，就接受裁决，偿还你的罪孽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x561F6DC39C099E90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064104020:1":{"text":"これが女神が与える最後の慈悲だ……","source_cn":"这是女神恩赐给你的，最后的怜悯——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBB4237D7F8E7145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064104021:0":{"text":"アタリア様ーー！どうかお待ちを！","source_cn":"不——！请等一等！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C4BE1B7B79648BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064104022:1":{"text":"ルイーザさん！？足は大丈夫なんですか！？","source_cn":"路易莎修女？！你腿脚不便，怎么还是赶过来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x719187E5121644A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064104023:1":{"text":"アタリア様、どうかお聞きください。かつてエミーニさんがブラックゴールド商会に身を置いていたのは事実ですが、それは生活に困窮してのことなのです！","source_cn":"尊敬的阿塔利娅大人，请听我一言：埃米妮确实曾加入过黑金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CFCC170D2B9840F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064104024:0":{"text":"十数年前、第二次神魔大戦のさなか、エンサ村は魔物の襲撃を受け、深刻な物資不足に陥りました……","source_cn":"十几年前，第二次神魔大战期间，恩莎村遭受了魔物的猛烈攻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE893CA837CF5F48C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064104025:1":{"text":"そのような状況下で、村に食料や生活物資を提供できたのはブラックゴールド商会だけでした。しかし、彼らの要求する代価があまりに高く、村人たちは家財を売り払い……","source_cn":"在那样的情况下，能为我们提供粮食和生活物资的只有黑金商...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB30DE1DCE13C9A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064104026:1":{"text":"もしエミーニさんが危険を承知で商会に身を投じ、皆のために稼いでくれなかったら、エンサ村はとっくに滅びていたでしょう。","source_cn":"如果不是埃米妮冒险加入黑金商会，帮大家寻找赚钱的机会，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AC60D6B59B117C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064104027:1":{"text":"彼女がさまざまな罪を犯したことは否定しません。ですが信じてください、彼女は決して悪人ではないのです。","source_cn":"我不会否认埃米妮曾犯下过种种罪孽，但恳求您相信，她绝非...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB14F179C645D8C5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064104028:0":{"text":"それに、戦争が終わってからは商会との関係も完全に断っています。リロさんと結婚して、子どもを授かってからは、家族に危害を及ぶことを恐れ、一歩も村を出ていません……","source_cn":"而且，战争结束后埃米妮便与黑金彻底断绝了来往。和列罗结...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82A57D58639A2B01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064104029:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064104030:0":{"text":"アタリア様、彼女は商会と縁を切って久しいのです。どうか今回だけ、お赦しいただけないでしょうか？","source_cn":"尊敬的阿塔利娅大人，我恳求您，看在她早已脱离黑金的份上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81E847A7004E37DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064104031:0":{"text":"ならば、黒魔術を使ったことはどう説明するのだ！？","source_cn":"但她仍在使用黑魔法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52ABA54E40AE06DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064104032:1":{"text":"彼女はリロさんを深く愛しておりました。彼の死をどうしても受け入れられず、ブラックゴールドに提供された薬を使ってしまったのです。","source_cn":"埃米妮与列罗感情甚笃，她只是一时无法接受列罗的离去，才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD03A2A45733E159C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064104033:1":{"text":"ですがご覧ください。その黒魔術の薬はまったく効果を示しませんでした。それこそ彼女と商会の間に何の関係もない証拠ではありませんか？","source_cn":"可是您看，黑魔法药剂并没有生效，这足以说明埃米妮和黑金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1517D2CF9BF23770","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064104034:1":{"text":"もう一度お願いします……どうかエミーニさんの罪をお赦しください！","source_cn":"我再次恳求您——请您宽恕埃米妮的罪孽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0442879EEA5187B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064104035:1":{"text":"あり得ないな。","source_cn":"不可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE749646A618006FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064104036:1":{"text":"女神デューラがこの世に降臨なさらなくなってわずか十年。人間たちはブラックゴールドとカタストロフが結託していたことさえ忘れている。","source_cn":"艾雅女神不再降临于世不过短短十年，凡人便忘却了当年的仇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA685C1ABBD7C2020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064104037:1":{"text":"――それが女神への冒涜でなくて何なのだ！断じて赦されぬ！","source_cn":"——这是对女神的亵渎与背叛！绝不可原谅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A6718BB652A8D86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064104038:1":{"text":"お前は女神に仕えるシスターでありながら、罪人の肩を持つとは何事か！","source_cn":"你身为侍奉女神的修女，亦不该为罪人发言！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33D98986A309D75F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064104039:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064104040:0":{"text":"どけ！何度も言わせるな！","source_cn":"幼童，让开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52AB8C756791635B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064104041:1":{"text":"い、イヤだ……誰にもお母さんを傷つけさせない！たとえ伝説のアタリアさまでも……うぅぅ……","source_cn":"不，不行……谁也不能伤害我妈妈！就算是传说中的阿塔利娅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F20ACED37B30D47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064104042:1":{"text":"……アタリア様、それはいけません！聖堂の教義にも反しています！","source_cn":"……阿塔利娅大人，您不能这样做！这有违圣堂的教义！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4052718BC327BA60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064104043:1":{"text":"邪悪を裁き、正義を守る……それこそ女神デューラより授けられた神託だ！","source_cn":"裁决邪恶，维护正义——这正是艾雅女神示下神谕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23ACBEDEFD34D580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064104044:1":{"text":"それはあなた方セレスチアルに授けられた神託かもしれませんが、聖堂が最も重んじる教義とは異なります。","source_cn":"这是艾雅女神传达给您和诸位半神的神谕，但圣堂最重要的教...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A99FEE3F3A3340","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064104045:1":{"text":"女神様が聖堂を築かれたのは、苦難にある人々に庇護を与えるためです。","source_cn":"女神建立圣堂，是为了给遭遇苦难的凡人提供庇护。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4414FF4F18AEA3AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064104046:1":{"text":"その中には、戦争で家族を失い、故郷を追われた難民だけでなく……エミーニさんのように、やむなく道を踏み外してしまった者も含まれます。","source_cn":"这些人里，不止因为战争而失去亲人、流离失所的难民……也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB311F23F9E5AF94E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064104047:1":{"text":"ブラックゴールドが女神様を冒涜しているのは確かで、エミーニさんも例外ではありません。ですが彼女が教会に物資を提供してくれなければ、その聖堂が最も重んじる教義を実践することさえできなかったのです！","source_cn"