say:65:1064104052:1":{"text":"彼女の信仰が揺らぐところを、わたしは見たことがありません。聖堂の教義に従い、より多くの人を救うためには、ブラックゴールドと行動を共にするしかなかったのです。","source_cn":"她对女神的信仰从未改变，只是为了遵从圣堂的教义、拯救更...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7AEA44C9502A52A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064104053:1":{"text":"それもまた一つの……心を深く苛む類の犠牲ではないでしょうか。そうでなければ彼女が今日に至るまで、罪の意識を抱え続けているはずがありません。","source_cn":"在我看来……这同样是一种牺牲，一种内心饱受煎熬的牺牲。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25CE54E62B8C83F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064104054:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064104055:1":{"text":"あ、アタリアさま……ぼくにはお母さんが何をしたのかよく分からないけど……女神さまを裏切ったりは絶対にしないよ！","source_cn":"阿、阿塔利娅大人，我不知道我妈妈有没有做过坏事……但是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6439D9EB021F102","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064104056:1":{"text":"だってお母さんはいつも言ってるもん。修道士やシスターの皆さんから多くを学んで、きちんと女神さまにお仕えするんだって。","source_cn":"妈妈一直教导我，要我跟着修士修女们多多学习，好好侍奉女神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B90E8996F04B80A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1064104057:1":{"text":"ぼくが友だちとケンカして怪我をさせちゃったときも、すぐに教会に行って懺悔し、赦しを乞いなさいって……","source_cn":"每次我犯了错，就算只是不小心害朋友划伤了手，她都会要求...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58E1DB66F3B0E6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064104058:1":{"text":"そんなお母さんが、悪人のはずがない……","source_cn":"我妈妈，她真的不是坏人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1000E1AEE0F91414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064104059:1":{"text":"だから、どうか許してください……ぼくも毎日、女神さまに懺悔するから……うぅぅ……","source_cn":"求求您，原谅她，我会每天都向女神忏悔的……呜呜呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2626AFE2C8EE6E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064104060:1":{"text":"ジラコ……やめて……本当にごめんね、全部お母さんが悪いの……","source_cn":"不……吉拉科，我可怜的孩子……都是妈妈的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76117F001F41D39B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064104061:1":{"text":"悪いことをしたら、自分で責任を取らなきゃいけないと前に教えたでしょ？お母さんは昔、たくさん悪いことをしてしまったの。だから……","source_cn":"还记得妈妈曾经教过你的吗？做错了事就要承担后果……妈妈...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x528D33D05D538456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064104062:1":{"text":"三度だけ猶予を与える。","source_cn":"……我可以给你三次机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EAC96CF644C3E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064104063:1":{"text":"ブラックゴールドに加担したのが一度目、黒魔術を使ったのが二度目。","source_cn":"为黑金效力，第一次。使用黑魔法，第二次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0AC01596AED95A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064104064:1":{"text":"もし次があれば、必ず裁きは下る。","source_cn":"若再有下一次，裁决必将降临。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x239B468795EB140E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064104065:1":{"text":"そ……それは、私の罪を赦してくださるのですか……？","source_cn":"您……您愿意宽恕我的罪孽……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A9ECCAC3D9F340","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064104066:1":{"text":"お前は殺しをしていない。聖堂を助けた。戦争は残酷で凡人の生は困難に満ちている。","source_cn":"你没有杀过人。你帮助了圣堂。战争很残酷，凡人过得艰难。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3CDF57E5C875A55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064104067:1":{"text":"三つの理由、ゆえに三度の猶予だ。","source_cn":"三个理由，三次机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC856E400668FD122","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1064104068:1":{"text":"お前のような者は、三度を超えて過ちを犯さぬ限り赦される。","source_cn":"和你相像的人，犯错不超过三次，可以宽恕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B5F53504914D4C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064104069:1":{"text":"アタリア様、人それぞれ事情は異なります。一律に数字で決めるわけにはいかないのでは……","source_cn":"阿塔利娅大人，每个人的情况都不同，或许不能这样算……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEF0ECCC57D3CFFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064104070:1":{"text":"私にすべての悪人の話を聞く時間はない。その者にどんな事情があろうとな。","source_cn":"我没有时间听完每个恶徒的故事，无法判断他们有无苦衷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF73A6AB03E6DD27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064104071:1":{"text":"罪の大小に関わらず、すべての悪は裁かれるべきなのだ。三度の猶予を与えられただけでも有難いと思え。","source_cn":"在我看来，每个恶徒都该受到裁决，无论罪行多少。三次机会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B781502BCE50F5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:87:1064104072:1":{"text":"だが――","source_cn":"可是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3F4540696EF509C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_rec